  "reference": "1 Samwil 9",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nwang’u ng’atu moko nuti ma pa Benyamin, ma nyinge Kic, ma wod Abiel, ma wod Zeror, ma wod Bekorath, ma wod Afia, ma wod Jabenyamini, e ng’atu ma tek ma jarukara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wode nuti, ma nyinge Saul, e jalawobi man en e ng’atu ma ber: man ng’atu moko mbe i kind nyithindho mir Israel ma ber ma sage: ugambre wi goke ku malu de e sagu dhanu ceke ku dongone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kana pa Kic, ma won Saul, girwinyo. Man Kic uwacu ni Saul ma wode kumae, Kawono gam jatic acel karacelo kudi, man iai, icidh iyeny kananegi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ekadhu kud i ng’om gudi pa Efraim, man ekadhu kud i ng’om Calica, ento ginwang’ugi ngo: gilund gikadhu kud i ng’om Calim, e gini keca ngo: man ekadhu kud i ng’om mi Jubenyamini, ento ginwang’ugi ngo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinde ma gibino ba ng’om Zuf, Saul uwacu ni jatic pare ma ni bang’e kumae, Bin, wadoki, vwa maru weko pido pi kana, man cwinye maru ringo i kumwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ewacu ire kumae, Nen kawono, dhanu pa Mungu nuti i adhura maeni, man en e ng’atu ma won yung; gin ceke m’ewacu timbre andha: kawono dong’ wacidh keca; kuno nyo ecopo yero iwa pi woth ma wacidho i ie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saul ulund uwacu ni jatic pare kumae, Ento, nen, tek wacidho, wabitero ang’o ni ng’atuno? kum kwen uthum i jamni mwa, man giramia mbe ma water ni dhanu pa Mungune: wabedo kud ang’o? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E jatic uloko lembe ni Saul kendo, ewacu kumae, Nen, abedo ku ng’et cekel mi mola ma tar mir ang’wende i cinga: abimio maeni ni dhanu pa Mungune, kara eyer iwa pi yo mwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Con i Israel, kinde ma ng’atu moko cidho nipenjo lembe ba Mungu, ewacu kumae, Wubin, man dong’ wacidhu ba jaeulembe; kum ng’atu ma julwong’e Jabila kawono naka julwong’e Jaeulembe.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saul ulund uwacu ni jatic pare kumae, Iwacu dre; bin, dong’ wacidhi. Kum kumeno gicidho bang’ adhura ka ma dhanu pa Mungune ni i ie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka giidho ka ma aidha bang’ adhura, ginwang’u jumanyir ubecitwomo pi, e gipenjogi kumae, Jaeulembe ni keni? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giloko lembe igi, giwacu kumae, Enuti; nen, eni i weng’i: tim pio kawono, kum ewok tinuni i adhura; kum dhanu gibedo ku lam tin i ka ma malu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka wumondo i adhura, e wubinwang’e pio pio, ma fokeidho ngo i ka ma malu nicamu; kum dhanu bicamu ngo ma fokebino ngo, kum emio mugisa wi lamne; man yo ku ng’eye ju ma julwong’ogi gicamu. Ka kumeno kawono wuidhi; kum i kinde maeni wubinwang’e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giidho malu bang’ adhurane; man ka giwok yor i adhurane, nen, Samwil uai ubino yor i bang’gi, kara eidh i ka ma malu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nwang’u Yehova nyutho ni Samwil ma fodi Saul kuwok ungo ceng’ acel, ewacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Urwo unyoni abioro ng’atu acel i beng’i kud i ng’om Benyamin, e ibiwire ebed jatelwic mi dhanu para Israel; man ebibodho dhanu para kud i cing’ Jufilisti: kum aneno wi dhanu para, kum ywak migi wok i bang’a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kinde ma Samwil uneno Saul, Yehova wacu ire kumae, Nen, ng’atu m’ayero pire iri! ng’atu maeni bibedo ku ng’ol wi dhanu para. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saul ulund ucoro ceng’ni ba Samwil i dhugang’, man ewacu kumae, Wac ira, akwei, ka ma ot pa jaeulembe ni i ie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Samwil uloko lembe ni Saul, man ewacu kumae, An a jaeulembe; idh malu i wang’a i ka ma malu, kum wabicamu wakudu tinuni: man kugweno abiweki cidho, man abiyero iri gin ceke ma ni i adundeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man pi kana peri m’urwinyo ceng’ adek m’ukadhu, kud iketh pidoii i kumgi; kum ginwangri. Man gin ceke ma juketho cwiny i kume i Israel en e pi ng’a? En e piri ngo, man pi ot pa wuru ceke? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Saul uloko lembe man ewacu kumae, An a Jabenyamini ngo, mi suru ma nok mir Israel ungo? man juot mwa e nok ma sagu juudi ceke mi suru pa Benyamin ungo? e kan iyero ira kumeni nedi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Samwil ugamu Saul ku jatic pare, man ekelogi i kusika mi welo, man eketho gijany i ka ma cu i kind ju ma julwong’o, ma gi ceng’ni dhanu pier adek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Samwil uwacu ni jatedo kumae, Kel makapiny m’amio i beng’i, m’awacu pire iri kumae, Kethe i beng’i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E jatedo ting’o bamb, ku ma ni i wie, man ekethe i wang’ Saul. Man Samwil uwacu kumae, Nen, maeno ma jukanu! kethe i weng’i icam; kum cil i nindo ma jung’olo jukane iri, kum awacu kumae, Alwong’o dhanu. Kum kumeno Saul gicamu giku Samwil i ceng’ maeca.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kinde ma giloro piny ku ka ma malu i adhura, e giweco giku Saul ku wi ot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giai pir kugweno: man etimbre kinde ma mombwa thumo, nia Samwil ulwong’o Saul ku wi ot, ewacu kumae, Ai, kara aciki. Man Saul uai, man gicidho woko gin ario, en giku Samwil, woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka gibeloro piny i kajik mir adhurane, Samwil uwacu ni Saul kumae, Wac ni jatic ukadh i wang’a (man ekadhu), ento ilar icung ti, kara aketh iwinj lembe pa Mungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "1SA.10",
